codex
The registered protocol and result report show the key headline pattern, but also an important qualification: K1 passes while K2 fails because A5b’s bootstrap upper bound exceeds 0.0936 on bike_hour (point estimate 0.058). I’m now checking the raw JSONL/NPZ outputs and scripts for denominator, policy-count, clustering, and twin-null consistency before assigning the verdict.
